<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 4.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JUNE 4.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Wednesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     June 04     June 03   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  275.320     275.160     247.020   11.46 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  310.450     310.990     306.830    1.18 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.980     159.400     158.970    0.01 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.152	47.280	47.182   -0.06 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  448.120     449.500     419.180    6.90 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.315     141.670     141.685   -0.26 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.188	16.196	16.185    0.02 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  236.510     237.250     212.430   11.34 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.881	 1.886	 1.888   -0.37 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.571	 1.578	 1.581   -0.63 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  190.300     192.255     183.135    3.91 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
